{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00128",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 3.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a few minutes behind, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.69,
      "end_seconds": 7.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.37,
      "end_seconds": 11.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "So, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.82,
      "end_seconds": 15.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.49,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "She's been having hot flushes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.7,
      "end_seconds": 22.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "So, when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.8,
      "end_seconds": 31.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.8,
      "end_seconds": 43.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.4,
      "end_seconds": 52.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Only a fan, and it's not much. Maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day. Warm rooms definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.53,
      "end_seconds": 56.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Right, what about night sweats, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.47,
      "end_seconds": 72.51,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "Yeah. Two months, you know, I'd say. About night sweats, I'd say a couple of times a week. And there's vaginal dryness as well, three days now. With vaginal dryness, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.33,
      "end_seconds": 76.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.1,
      "end_seconds": 83.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.41,
      "end_seconds": 87.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Right, any weight loss or breast lumps at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.81,
      "end_seconds": 89.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.13,
      "end_seconds": 93.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Have you had any bleeding after sex or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.11,
      "end_seconds": 97.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I haven't had bleeding after sex or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.44,
      "end_seconds": 104.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.7,
      "end_seconds": 106.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.47,
      "end_seconds": 109.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.12,
      "end_seconds": 113.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.48,
      "end_seconds": 118.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.7,
      "end_seconds": 121.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "My brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.43,
      "end_seconds": 127.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.03,
      "end_seconds": 138.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Alendronate. I take it 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones. It's thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 139.37,
      "end_seconds": 147.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the thyroxine was 37.5 micrograms. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.82,
      "end_seconds": 151.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.51,
      "end_seconds": 159.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.58,
      "end_seconds": 164.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.73,
      "end_seconds": 169.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.51,
      "end_seconds": 171.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.86,
      "end_seconds": 187.0,
      "duration_seconds": 14.14,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for five years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Yes, high blood pressure. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.59,
      "end_seconds": 189.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.0,
      "end_seconds": 192.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.55,
      "end_seconds": 196.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.1,
      "end_seconds": 197.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.93,
      "end_seconds": 212.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.36,
      "end_seconds": 215.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.78,
      "end_seconds": 216.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Okay, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.86,
      "end_seconds": 220.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.86,
      "end_seconds": 226.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.04,
      "end_seconds": 230.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Yes, eggs, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.03,
      "end_seconds": 234.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.25,
      "end_seconds": 249.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.44,
      "end_seconds": 276.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, respiratory rate 18, BP is 128 over 72, pulse 71. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.96,
      "end_seconds": 287.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.26,
      "end_seconds": 290.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.2,
      "end_seconds": 294.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.49,
      "end_seconds": 309.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Blood pressure and pulse are fine, and there are no breast lumps on examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.33,
      "end_seconds": 337.01,
      "duration_seconds": 24.68,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with perimenopausal symptoms at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be a thyroid problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.97,
      "end_seconds": 344.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.32,
      "end_seconds": 360.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.77,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like perimenopausal symptoms, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hot flushes, and no weight loss or breast lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.56,
      "end_seconds": 363.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.72,
      "end_seconds": 389.33,
      "duration_seconds": 24.61,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a bone density scan for menopause. We should do a thyroid test for hot flushes. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.29,
      "end_seconds": 396.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.65,
      "end_seconds": 402.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.62,
      "end_seconds": 412.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 416.86,
      "end_seconds": 418.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.65,
      "end_seconds": 428.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Alright, just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 429.78,
      "end_seconds": 434.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.43,
      "end_seconds": 438.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.02,
      "end_seconds": 442.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 442.98,
      "end_seconds": 443.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}